---
layout: layouts/base.njk
pageTitle: "Contact"
description: "Contact [Artist name] about buying a work, a commission, prints or an exhibition."
bodyClass: page-contact
---
<header class="page-head">
  <h1 class="page-title">Contact</h1>
  <p class="lede">Questions about a work, a commission, prints or an exhibition. I usually reply within [reply time].</p>
</header>

<div class="contact-grid">
  <form class="contact-form" name="contact" method="POST" action="/thanks/?form=contact" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="company" data-contact-form>
    <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact">
    <input type="hidden" name="work" value="" data-work-field>
    <p class="hp"><label>Leave empty <input name="company" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></p>
    <div class="field">
      <label for="c-name">Name</label>
      <input id="c-name" name="name" type="text" required autocomplete="name">
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <label for="c-email">Email</label>
      <input id="c-email" name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email">
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <label for="c-subject">Subject</label>
      <select id="c-subject" name="subject" required>
        <option>Commission</option>
        <option>Purchase</option>
        <option>Prints</option>
        <option>Exhibition</option>
        <option selected>Other</option>
      </select>
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <label for="c-message">Message</label>
      <textarea id="c-message" name="message" rows="7" required></textarea>
    </div>
    <button class="btn btn-solid" type="submit">Send message</button>
    <p class="fine">I use your details only to reply to you. See the <a class="pencil" href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.</p>
  </form>

  <aside class="contact-aside">
    <section class="commissions prose" aria-labelledby="commissions-title">
      <h2 id="commissions-title">Commissions</h2>
      <p>I take on a small number of commissions in oil and in pencil.</p>
      <ol>
        <li>Send me a message with the subject “Commission”. Tell me the subject, size and medium you have in mind.</li>
        <li>I reply with a price and a time. Prices start at [starting price]. Sizes run from [smallest size] to [largest size].</li>
        <li>When we agree, I ask for a deposit of [deposit]. The rest is due when the work is finished.</li>
        <li>A commission takes about [time] from the deposit to delivery.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>
    <section class="social" aria-labelledby="social-title">
      <h2 id="social-title" class="eyebrow">Elsewhere</h2>
      <ul>
        {%- for s in site.social %}
        <li><a class="pencil" href="{{ s.url }}" rel="me noopener">{{ s.label }}</a></li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
    </section>
  </aside>
</div>
